{
  "id": "54",
  "title": "相心赋",
  "guide": "本篇讨论“相心赋”相关旧法。阅读时先提取月令、日主、透藏、制化与岁运等条件，再与其他章节交叉核对，不直接套用结果性断语。",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "人居六合，心相五行，欲晓一生，辩形察性。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "54-f059505a0df1785f9013-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "官星愷悌，贵气轩昂，性优游而仁慈宽大、怀豁达而和畅声音、丰姿美而秀丽、性格敏而聪明。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "54-c0d62c5b729130ae91f0-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "印綬主多智慧、丰身自在心慈。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "54-7e3aacdd0e802bd4f2c1-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "食神善能饮食、体厚而喜謳歌。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "54-d21cd98d3d9c8c5d00a3-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "偏官七杀，势压三公，喜酒色而偏争好斗、爱轩昂而扶弱欺强、情性如虎、急躁如风。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "54-cf45162cba394ccd159b-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "梟印当权，使心机而始勤终惰、好学艺而多学少成。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "54-deeecd50b16d52ccdf8a-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "偏印劫刃，出祖离家，外象谦和尚义、内实狠毒无知、有刻剥之意、无慈惠之心。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "54-0e8a8a9bfde47a0a05ea-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "偏正财露，轻财好义，爱人趋奉、好说是非、嗜酒贪花，亦係如此。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "54-3a6fe609251f0d42819b-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "伤官伤尽，多艺多能，使心机而傲物气高、多譎诈而侮人志大、颧高骨俊、眼大眉粗。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "54-b263b966b0f255b844a8-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "日德心善稳厚、而作事慈祥。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "54-70b9bb730eb403abd77f-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "魁罡性严有操持、而为人聪敏。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "54-04c306d4e61598ab142a-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "日贵夜贵，朝荣暮荣，为人纯粹而有姿色、作仁德而不骄奢。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "54-f3d3837139f5efc45aa6-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "金神贵格，火地奇哉！有刚断明敏之才、无刻剥欺瞒之心。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "54-5184a694bfdc3760ac0d-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "乙巳鼠贵，遇午冲，贫如顏子。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "54-b8ebe1740d96a699dd80-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "壬骑龙背，逢丁破，慾比申棖。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "54-eb848bfb4d583a5776ad-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "井栏飞天，其心傲物。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "54-1858b408e0822d483fb5-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "刑合趋艮（寅），智足多仁。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "54-57a0cd87c43c20d15c8a-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "六甲趋乾（亥），主仁慈而刚介心平。（六甲趋乾格）",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "54-0512ecadfbdc36f61d97-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "五阴会局，为人佛口蛇心。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "54-513de2698a9f488eb489-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "二德印生，作事施恩布德。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "54-6802a4250d7658429d02-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "五行有化，看何气而推。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "54-98cc1a418cb939f20e15-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "四柱无情，取元干而论也。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "54-6ed435cb05b20f53adc3-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "且，火炎土燥，必声洪而好礼；水清润下，主言悟而施仁。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "54-2c10012ab1776c2383a4-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "金白水清，质黑肥圆。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "54-1da40e3e69548b7404aa-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "土气厚重，信在四时。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "54-3c5898fb365020cee31f-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "汇合如然，失时反此；事则举其大略，须要察其细微。欲识情理，学者用心于此。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "54-99fe2e09721374e7e447-0",
      "translation": null
    }
  ],
  "editionId": "yuanhai-6fbd3c1c68ee5326ccef",
  "version": "ca513874fd5e3ef7467b"
}
